hello there  welcome back everyone to stream in the  galaxy my name is rocket riley and today  we're going to be going over everything  we know so far about the obi-wan kenobi  series coming soon to disney plus but  before we get started if you're new to  the channel please hit the subscribe  button and click the bell icon to be  notified when we upload a new video the  obi-wan kenobi series will be set 10  years after the events of revenge of the  sith where he faced his greatest defeat  the downfall and corruption of his best  friend and jedi apprentice anakin  skywalker otherwise known as the evil  sith lord darth vader the show will  follow obi-wan as he watches over the  young luke skywalker on tatooine facing  unknown threats and overcoming many  obstacles along the way which will  likely take him off planet the show is  set to release sometime in 2022 on  disney plus and it'll feature a total of  six episodes the series began production  in april of 2021 and finished filming by  september of 2021 according to an  interview with ewan mcgregor while the  specifics of the obi-wan kenobi story  remain unclear several canonical star  wars stories do reveal some of the  veteran jedi's activities during his  post revenge of the sith exile on  tatooine in the comics titled from the  journals of obi-wan kenobi luke  skywalker discovers his old masters  diaries which detail what obi-wan was up  to during this time we know he was  frustrated at having to keep his jedi  status a secret and his inability to  train the young luke in the ways of the  force  at one point uncle owen even demanded  that kenobi keep his distance from the  family and their moisture farm however  obi-wan still did his best to protect  the family including saving owen from a  run-in with black chrysanthen a wookie  bounty hunter we also recently received  a first look at the series on disney  plus which featured some amazing concept  art in the first piece we see obi-wan  writing a neop on tatooine looking older  and more rugged closer to how alec  guinness appeared in a new hope ewan  mcgregor will reprise his role as  obi-wan kenobi on screen for the first  time since 2005's revenge of the sith  although he had a couple of brief voice  cameos in the force awakens and the rise  of skywalker the second piece of concept  art features an inquisitor ship along  with an inquisitor and two stormtroopers  while it had been rumored that some  inquisitors may show up on tatooine in  search of jedi such as obi-wan and  potential jedi like luke it's now  basically confirmed with this concept  art we've seen these jedi hunting  inquisitors before in some of the star  wars animated series as well as in the  video game jedi fallen order  there have also been rumors that  characters such as darth maul will make  an appearance in the show and  considering maul's long history with  kenobi this seems pretty likely  a february 2021 instagram post from ray  park the actor who plays darth maul may  also hint at his return  the third piece of concept art shows us  what looks like an underwater or  otherwise off tatooine empire base with  stormtroopers standing in small groups  this further points to the idea that the  show may take us off tatooine if  off-world threats arise which obi-wan  must face  the fourth piece of concept art features  darth vader sitting in a throne room  perhaps in his fortress on mustafar as  confirmed at disney's investor day in  december of 2020 actor hayden  christensen will be joining the cast as  darth vader in the concept art vader  sits in front of a hologram potentially  speaking with emperor palpatine so  there's a chance we could see another  appearance from ian mcdermott the last  and maybe the most exciting piece of  concept art shows a fiery rematch  between obi-wan and his apprentice  anakin  when obi-wan left anakin munilated and  burning on the volcanic surface of  mustafar he must have assumed anakin had  died so we're guessing the fact that  he's alive as darth vader is going to  come as quite a big shock to obi-wan and  this revelation could be a contributing  factor to how kenobi is willing to leave  tatooine since we know there's almost no  way kenobi would risk the empire or the  sith coming near luke on the other hand  if vader realizes that kenobi is alive  it's likely that he would be obsessed  with tracking him down and eliminating  him we already know that after the  destruction of the first death star  darth vader traveled to jabba's palace  to recruit a bounty hunter boba fett to  track down a certain force sensitive  pilot so vader making his way to  tatooine in the show is not out of the  question vader and kenobi's eagerly  anticipated rematch doesn't have to  retcon or go against previously  established canon either while we'd  assumed their battle on mustafar was the  last time they had saw each other before  a new hope the timeline is somewhat  vague  in a new hope vader describes kenobi as  a presence i've not felt since and that  sense could be this encounter we see in  the concept art  either way it'll be so exciting to see  vader go toe to toe with his old master  once again  in april of 2021 the full cast for the  show was revealed joel edgerton and  bonnie pierce are confirmed to be  returning as uncle owen and aunt baru  lars the couple who raised luke  skywalker after obi-wan left the child  on tatooine  other confirmed cast members include  camille nanjani from the big sick and  the eternals  indira varma from game of thrones rupert  friend from homeland o'shea jackson jr  from straight out of compton  sung kang from the fast and the furious  series simone kessel from the crossing  benny safty from good time and maya  erskine from penn 15.  rumors say that erskine will be in at  least three episodes so erskine's  character may have a prominent role in  the story  the biggest name who may be returning  though is luke skywalker at this point  in the timeline luke would be around 10  years old so we may get to see a young  luke skywalker before the events of a  new hope  after all luke already knows old ben at  the start of a new hope and the whole  reason kenobi stayed on tatooine was to  keep an eye on luke when ewan mcgregor  was asked if he was doing screen tests  with potential actors for young luke he  said that's very possible i don't know  and we all know mcgregor is good at  keeping secrets as he held in the secret  about the kenobi series for years so  there may be some truth to the rumors  surrounding luke's return  other characters who are rumored to  return are qui gon jin and master yoda  at the end of revenge of the sith yoda  says to obi-wan an old friend has  learned the path to immortality one who  has returned from the netherworld of the  force your old master meaning that  qui-gon had learned how to become a  force ghost so while we may not see  qui-gon in the flesh it's likely that  he'll return in a spiritual form  we may also see yoda teaching obi-wan  how to master this ability as we know  both yoda and obi-wan have mastered it  by the later star wars films the series  is also confirmed to be using the same  volume technology that was used for the  filming of the mandalorian the volume is  a completely domed virtual set with  screens that actually put actors and  actresses in the stories environment  rather than using blue screens and green  screens the results of this look  absolutely stunning in the mandalorian  so we can probably expect a similar  product in the obi-wan kenobi series  lastly we know who the writers and  directors are for the series deborah  chao who directed two episodes of the  mandalorian will be the head director of  the show and army of the dead writer  joby herald is the head writer for the  six part series  lucasfilm president kathleen kennedy  michelle rejuan chao mcgregor and harold  will serve as executive producers  overall this show looks like it'll have  an exciting story taking us on thrilling  adventures with the fan favorite  character obi-wan once again i can't  wait to see what the series brings us  and i hope it brings some clarity to the  events that happened between episodes 3  and 4. ewan mcgregor recently said in an  interview to come back and to play him  again obi-wan kenobi has been absolutely  brilliant i'm really enjoying it and i'm  sure the fans will absolutely enjoy it  too only a sith deals in absolutes  well that's gonna be everything we know  about the obi-wan kenobi series so far  if you enjoyed the video please hit the  like button and don't forget to  subscribe for more great content what  are your theories for the show will we  actually get to see a young luke on  screen we'd like to know what you think  so drop your thoughts in the comment  section below  from everyone here at stream in the  galaxy we hope you have a great day and  thanks for watching

